 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Not exactly, no.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san.\nGood evening.": "",
  "Good evening, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Oh, you're...": "",
  "Hashimoto. I showed you\nto Shono's lab the other day.": "",
  "I showed you to Shono's lab the other day.\nI'm Hashimoto.": "",
  "Oh, right.\nGood to see you.": "",
  "Oh... right! Good to see you.": "",
  "Do you need something\nmore from him?": "",
  "Do you need something more\nfrom him?": "",
  "Yagami-san, there he is.\nIt's Shono.": "",
  "There he is, Yagami-san.\nIt's Shono.": "",
  "Gotta run!": "",
  "Gotta run.": "",
  "Over there, by the stairs.": "",
  "Found him.\nLooks like he's talking to Kido.": "",
  "What do we do?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There are some researchers talking over there.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There are some researchers\ntalking over there.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Is that...\nNo, not him.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(No, I think Shono's shorter\nthan that.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Is that Kido?\nI'm looking for Shono, though.)\n": "",
  "Okay, let's move in.": "",
  "Let's move in.": "",
  "Well if it isn't Yagami-san!\nKamurocho's finest private eye.": "",
  "Well, if it isn't Yagami-san!\nKamurocho's finest private eye.": "",
  "You again.": "",
  "...You.": "",
  "This had better be the last time\nI see you in this Center.": "",
  "Are you aware that I filed a complaint\nwith the bar association about you?": "",
  "I've filed a complaint\nwith the bar association.": "",
  "Aren't you the Vice Minister of Health?": "",
  "You're that bureaucrat, right?\nVice Minister of Health, was it?": "",
  "It's Ichinose.": "",
  "Yeah, I remember you from the other day.\nLooks like you come here often.": "",
  "Of course. The success of AD-9\nis a matter of national importance.": "",
  "As such, there are a great many discussions\nthat need to be had. Patents, legislation, the like.": "",
  "As such, there are a great many discussions to be had\nabout patents, legislation, and the like.": "",
  "Now, I suggest you leave before\nI call the guards to escort you out.": "",
  "Now, I suggest you leave before\nI call security.": "",
  "So much for the plan.\nShono's gonna be on red alert after that.": "",
  "Doubt he'll be coming down through\nthe lobby now. What do we do?": "",
  "Doubt he'll be visiting the lobby now.\nWhat do we do?": "",
  "Hashimoto-san.\nSorry for running off earlier.": "",
  "It's all right.\nI, um... saw what happened.": "",
  "It's all right.\nI actually saw what happened...": "",
  "Dr. Shono slipped away\nfrom you, huh?": "",
  "Shono-sensei slipped away\nfrom you, huh?": "",
  "Yeah. We just wanted to talk, too...": "",
  "Hm. He has been especially busy lately.": "",
  "Hm. He <font_kind=yakuza_italic>has</font_kind> been\nespecially busy lately.": "",
  "Lately he only goes home once\nevery three days or so.": "",
  "Shono-sensei spends all day in his lab,\nand only goes home once every three days.": "",
  "Even so, he makes his morning rounds\nat the hospital every single day without fail.": "",
  "I can't overstate how much respect\nI have for him.": "",
  "You really have to admire him.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Shono makes his rounds every morning?)</color>": "",
  "What do you mean, \"rounds\"?": "",
  "Uh... What do you mean, \"rounds\"?": "",
  "It's a little custom of his. He takes a walk around\nthe hospital every morning. Been doing it for years.": "",
  "Right... Shono-sensei considers it his morning walk\naround the hospital. He's been doing it for years now.": "",
  "Right.\nHe did the same three years ago.": "",
  "Oh yeah... He did the same\nthree years ago.": "",
  "Passion like his is what's going\nto make or break our research.": "",
  "His passion will surely bring about\nsome amazing new drugs.": "",
  "And with that, I should be going.\nSorry to be so curt.": "",
  "Now, I'm sorry to run,\nbut I really should be going.": "",
  "Goodbye, then.": "",
  "Security on Shono's lab is airtight.\nCan't get in without a special gold keycard.": "",
  "We know security on Shono's lab is airtight.\nCan't get in without a gold keycard.": "",
  "But that's not the case for the hospital wing.\nMeaning we have some time to kill until Shono's rounds.": "",
  "But... that's not the case for the hospital wing.\nMeaning we can kill time until Shono's rounds.": "",
  "Wait, you wanna chill 'til the morning\nand ambush him in the hospital?": "",
  "Yeah. Just have to sneak in\nbetween now and then.": "",
  "Yup. Just have to sneak in\nbetween now and then.": "",
  "Guess the next question is...\nWhere do we get in?": "",
  "Makes sense...\nNow, where do we get in?": "",
  "Let's check the map.": "",
  "This is the garage for the hospital.": "",
  "The service entrance, that is.\nAnyone who makes deliveries parks down here.": "",
  "The service entrance.\nAnyone who makes deliveries parks down here.": "",
  "Heh, this could work.": "",
  "Heh... this could work.": "",
  "That's Director Kido's office.\nThere's nothing we need up there.": "",
  "The Director's office.\nKido's in there... We'd better stay away.": "",
  "The research wing where Shono's lab is.\nCan't sneak in with all that security.": "",
  "The research wing. Shono's lab is in here...\nCan't sneak in with all that security.": "",
  "Why don't we just steal a keycard, then?\nOne of them gold ones.": "",
  "So, why don't we just steal a keycard?\nA gold one, right?": "",
  "No need to get violent.\nMost of those researchers are innocent.": "",
  "We should just sneak into the hospital\nand wait until morning for Shono.": "",
  "If we just sneak into the hospital and wait,\nShono should pop up.": "",
  "This is the research wing.\nShono works here.": "",
  "This is research wing.\nShono works here.": "",
  "The security gate.\nThe research wing is just past here.": "",
  "This gate leads to the hospital.": "",
  "Here's the gate.\nIt leads to the hospital.": "",
  "You need a keycard to get past, though.": "",
  "But... we'll need a keycard\nto get past security.": "",
  "Guess we're sneaking in\nthrough the garage, huh?": "",
  "Yeah. Come on, let's head outside.\nWe should go scope the place out.": "",
  "Yup. Come on, let's head outside.\nGotta scope the place out.": "",
  "Are you from\nthe Yagami Detective Agency?": "",
  "I'm the head of security here.\nThe name's Mashiko.": "",
  "I'm Mashiko, the head of security here.": "",
  "The vice minister has instructed me\nto see you two out.": "",
  "Vice minister's orders. I'll have to see\nthe both of you out of the building.": "",
  "Ichinose-san did?": "",
  "Ichinose-san's orders?": "",
  "You blind or something?\nWe're already leaving.": "",
  "Look, you blind or something?\nWe're already leaving.": "",
  "I'm sorry, but I'm going to have to escort\nyou the rest of the way.": "",
  "I'm sorry, but I'll have to escort you\nthe rest of the way.": "",
  "That's a lot of guys for an \"escort.\"": "",
  "How many men did you\nthink you'd need?": "",
  "Hey, where the hell're you taking us?\nAnswer me, asshole!": "",
  "This should be fine.": "",
  "This should be far enough.": "",
  "Mashiko-san, yeah?\nWhat exactly did Ichinose tell you to do?": "",
  "Make sure you never show your\nface here again.": "",
  "Make sure you never show\nyour face here again.": "",
  "The fuck...?": "",
  "That doesn't look like\nstandard-issue guard equipment.": "",
  "Is that thing standard-issue around here?": "",
  "That's 'cause it's not.\nThis is more of a... personal effect.": "",
  "No, not really.\nThis is more of a... personal effect.": "",
  "And lemme guess,\nyou're off the clock?": "",
  "And lemme guess, you're off the clock?": "",
  "You bet. I'm on break...\nAnd I'm ready to blow off some steam.": "",
  "You bet. I'm on break...\nand I'm ready to blow off some steam.": "",
  "Now fight me!": "",
  "Let's go, detective!": "",
  "C'mon, do you have to keep waving?": "",
  "Hey, I think they got the point.": "",
  "Whaddya mean?\nThey're the only reason we got in so easy.": "",
  "True. Though ultimately, we have\nthe vice minister to thank for that.": "",
  "True. Though I gotta say,\nthe vice minister was a big help.": "",
  "So? How's it look?\nAny different from three years ago?": "",
  "Well? How's it look?\nAny different from three years ago?": "",
  "Not even a little bit.": "",
  "Nope. Not a bit.": "",
  "Well, it's open.": "",
  "You're not going in?": "",
  "And lose my perfectly good smoking spot?\nWe'll be fine here for now. Just gotta wait for dawn.": "",
  "What, and lose my perfectly good smoking spot?\nWe'll be fine here for now. Just gotta wait for dawn.": "",
  "Great...": "",
  "Yagami-san. Have you decided\nhow you're gonna approach Shono?": "",
  "Yagami-san. Any idea how\nyou're gonna approach Shono?": "",
  "We just have to confront him head on.\nWhere we go from there depends on his response.": "",
  "We just have to confront him head on.\nWhere we go from there is up to him.": "",
  "You don't wanna negotiate with him?": "",
  "You don't wanna negotiate?": "",
  "I doubt we have the time for that.": "",
  "Nah. I doubt we have\nthe time for that.": "",
  "After all, this is probably the only chance\nwe'll get to talk to Shono before Ayabe's trial.": "",
  "After all, this is probably the only chance we'll get\nto talk to Shono before Ayabe's trial.": "",
  "...Guess so, huh.": "",
  "...Guess so.": "",
  "Meaning we don't have time\nto waste on negotiation.": "",
  "Speakin' of Shono,\nI actually had an idea.": "",
  "Though, ah... speakin' of Shono,\nI actually had an idea.": "",
  "Hm? What's that?": "",
  "Well, the murder at\nthe ADDC three years ago...": "",
  "The murder at the ADDC\nthree years ago...": "",
  "The thought is that Shono framed Okubo\nfor that and got away with it, right?": "",
  "Shono was behind it. He even framed Okubo\nfor that whole thing, right?": "",
  "But you defended Okubo, and won.": "",
  "But you still defended Okubo,\nand won.": "",
  "Wouldn't the cops've started looking for the real killer\nonce they realized Okubo wasn't their guy?": "",
  "So after he got cleared... wouldn't the cops\nhave started chasing the real killer?": "",
  "I'm sure they did.": "",
  "But... it wasn't long\nuntil Okubo killed again.": "",
  "But... it wasn't long until Okubo killed again.\nThe next murder changed everything.": "",
  "They didn't have much reason\nto keep searching, I would imagine.": "",
  "Thanks to that... I figure they didn't bother\ndoing much searching.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(And thanks to that, Shono's escaped consequences\nfor what he did.)</color>": "",
  "Got that right.": "",
  "Everyone pegged him as the murderer.": "",
  "Everyone pinned him as a murderer.": "",
  "Makes sense they'd think he's\nthe one responsible for Waku-san, too.": "",
  "After that, no wonder they thought he killed\nWaku-san, too. Anyone would believe that.": "",
  "But... don't you think that's kinda convenient?\nFor one person in particular, I mean.": "",
  "But that's exactly it. It seems a little too convenient...\nfor one guy in particular.": "",
  "The guy who was doing human experiments\nat the ADDC. Shono.": "",
  "Your point?": "",
  "I think he killed Emi Terasawa\nand pinned the blame on Okubo.": "",
  "I think he killed Emi Terasawa and\npinned the blame on Okubo.": "",
  "With all he had to lose...\nDon't you think Shono had a motive?": "",
  "With all he had to lose... don't you think\nShono had a motive?": "",
  "I dunno about you, but that sounds like\na damn clear motive to me.": "",
  "I guess, but... Wait no, you're right.\nEmi-chan would have been a threat.": "",
  "Then... that's why Emi-chan had to die?": "",
  "But could he really do it?": "",
  "Is he capable of that...?": "",
  "How long have you been thinking this?": "",
  "When did you figure that out?": "",
  "Since you told me what a mess\nOkubo is now. It was just a feeling.": "",
  "Since we've been talking about what a mess\nOkubo is now. It was just a feeling.": "",
  "Honestly, I wanted to believe\nhe didn't kill her.": "",
  "Honestly, I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>wanted</font_kind> to believe him.\nTo believe he didn't kill her.": "",
  "But I just couldn't bring\nmyself to do it.": "",
  "But I just couldn't bring myself\nto do it.": "",
  "Emi-chan was...\nsuch a good person.": "",
  "Emi-chan was... such a good person.": "",
  "I wasn't gonna let it slide.\nNot after what Okubo-kun did to her.": "",
  "For her sake, I wasn't gonna let it slide.\nNot after what Okubo-kun did to her.": "",
  "But after all this time, it turns out...\nShono is the real killer?": "",
  "And now, if the real killer wasn't Okubo,\nbut Shono instead, then...": "",
  "Nothing's for sure without evidence.\nThis is all just unfounded speculation.": "",
  "I can't be sure. We don't have evidence.\nAll this is just unfounded speculation.": "",
  "But doesn't it make you wanna\ntalk to Shono even more?": "",
  "But doesn't it make this\nchat with Shono all the better?": "",
  "Yeah. I've never been\nthis ready for morning.": "",
  "Yeah. I've never been this ready for morning...\nIt's about time I got answers.": "",
  "Open up! Hey!\nDo you hear me!? ": "",
  "Funny that we'd end up\nhere of all places.": "",
  "Stuck in this room, huh?\nFunny that we'd end up here of all places.": "",
  "This is the room, right?\nWhere Waku-san was staying.": "",
  "This is the one, right?\nWhere Waku-san spent his days.": "",
  "The man who died after you used him\nas a test subject for AD-9.": "",
  "One of your patients... The man who died\nafter you used him to test AD-9.": "",
  "Why'd you do it, Shono? For the glory?\nThought nobody'd notice one missing dementia patient?": "",
  "Why'd you do it? Thought nobody'd notice\none missing dementia patient?": "",
  "What are you talking about?\nGet out of here!": "",
  "What are you talking about?\nGet out of here, now!": "",
  "This is trespassing!": "",
  "Hmph. You sure you want us to go?": "",
  "Hmph. Are you sure that's\nwhat you want?": "",
  "I thought you'd be a little more curious\nabout how much of your secret I really know.": "",
  "Doesn't it make you wonder? How many of your secrets\ndo I actually know?": "",
  "I don't know what\nyou're talking about.": "",
  "What? I don't know what you...": "",
  "You're the one backing the Mole.\nIsn't that right?": "",
  "Huh? How dare you accuse me of—": "",
  "That's not all I know. Hamura's the middle-man.\nYou pretty satisfied with his work?": "",
  "You direct the Mole, and Hamura's the middleman.\nYou pretty satisfied with their work?": "",
  "I won't stand for this baseless slander!\nWhat proof do you have!?": "",
  "You just made a big mistake, Shono-san.": "",
  "You've been working nonstop\non this new drug, right?": "",
  "You've been working round the clock\non this new drug, right?": "",
  "No way the street slang about a murderer\nwould have reached your ears.": "",
  "A guy like you... wouldn't be\nup on the latest Kamurocho slang.": "",
  "You were supposed to ask\nwhat the Mole is.": "",
  "Shouldn't the question\nhave been, \"What is the Mole\"?": "",
  "Wh-What is the Mole?": "",
  "...Wh-What's the Mole?": "",
  "There's a good boy.": "",
  "Good boy.": "",
  "The serial killer who's been\ngouging people's eyes out.": "",
  "The serial killer in Kamurocho who's been\ngouging people's eyes out. We call him the Mole.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Not exactly, no.": "ก็ไม่เชิงหรอกนะ",
  "What do we do?": "เราจะทำยังไงดีครับ?",
  "You again.": "แกอีกแล้วเหรอ",
  "The fuck...?": "อะไรวะเนี่ย...?",
  "Great...": "เยี่ยมไปเลย...",
  "Hm? What's that?": "อืม? นั่นอะไรน่ะ?",
  "Got that right.": "พูดถูกเผงเลย",
  "Your point?": "แล้วไง?"
 }
}
